      "summary": "ការបង្កើត Authentication Middleware (`protect`)៖\n\n- **ទាញយក Token**៖ ចាប់យក JWT ពី `Authorization: Bearer <token>` Header ឬពី Request Cookies។\n- **ផ្ទៀងផ្ទាត់ Signature**៖ ហៅ `jwt.verify(token, process.env.JWT_SECRET)` ដើម្បី Decode Payload។\n- **ស្វែងរក User ក្នុង Database**៖ ពិនិត្យមើលថា User នៅមានវត្តមាន និងមិនទាន់ត្រូវបានលុប ឬ Ban។\n- **ភ្ជាប់ទៅ req.user**៖ ភ្ជាប់ User Document ទៅ `req.user` សម្រាប់ឱ្យ Controllers បន្ទាប់ប្រើប្រាស់។",
      "tip": "Always check `user.changedPasswordAfter(decoded.iat)`. If a user resets their password, previously issued tokens must be rejected immediately.",
      "objective": "Construct a production-ready protect middleware enforcing authentication across Express endpoints.",
      "expectedOutcome": "Centralized route protection injecting req.user into downstream handlers.",
      "codeSnippet": "// middleware/auth.middleware.js\nimport jwt from \"jsonwebtoken\";\nimport { User } from \"../models/user.model.js\";\nimport { AppError } from \"../utils/AppError.js\";\n\nexport const protect = async (req, res, next) => {\n  try {\n    // 1. Extract Bearer token from header\n    const authHeader = req.headers.authorization;\n    if (!authHeader || !authHeader.startsWith(\"Bearer \")) {\n      throw new AppError(\"You are not logged in. Please log in to gain access.\", 401);\n    }\n    const token = authHeader.split(\" \")[1];\n\n    // 2. Verify token\n    const decoded = jwt.verify(token, process.env.JWT_ACCESS_SECRET);\n\n    // 3. Check if user still exists\n    const currentUser = await User.findById(decoded.sub);\n    if (!currentUser) {\n      throw new AppError(\"The user belonging to this token no longer exists.\", 401);\n    }\n\n    // 4. Attach verified user to request object\n    req.user = currentUser;\n    next();\n  } catch (err) {\n    next(err);\n  }\n};"
