      "codeSnippet": "// OWASP API Top 10 Security Checklist:\n// 1. Broken Object Level Authorization (IDOR) -> Verify resource ownership\n// 2. Broken Authentication                    -> bcrypt + short-lived JWTs\n// 3. Broken Object Property Level (Mass Assign) -> Whitelist incoming fields\n// 4. Unrestricted Resource Consumption         -> express-rate-limit\n// 5. Broken Function Level Authorization      -> restrictTo() guards\n// 6. Server-Side Request Forgery (SSRF)       -> Validate outbound URLs\n// 7. Security Misconfiguration                -> Helmet headers + hide stack traces\n// 8. Lack of Protection from Automated Threats -> Captcha / IP throttling\n// 9. Improper Assets Management               -> Deprecate old API versions\n// 10. Unsafe Consumption of APIs              -> Validate 3rd party payloads"
