      "summary": "ការកំណត់ចំនួន Request (Rate Limiting) ជាមួយ express-rate-limit៖\n\n- **ការពារ DoS Attacks**៖ ទប់ស្កាត់ការផ្ញើ Requests ហួសប្រមាណដែលធ្វើឱ្យ Server គាំង ឬកកស្ទះ។\n- **Global Limiter**៖ កំណត់កម្រិតទូទៅ (ឧ. 100 requests ក្នុង 15 នាទី សម្រាប់ IP មួយ)។\n- **HTTP 429 Status**៖ ឆ្លើយតប `429 Too Many Requests` នៅពេល Client ប្រើប្រាស់លើសកម្រិតកំណត់។",
      "tip": "Always configure `legacyHeaders: false` and `standardHeaders: true` to comply with modern IETF rate-limiting header specifications.",
      "objective": "Implement global and route-specific rate limits to defend against DoS and abusive scraping.",
      "expectedOutcome": "Resilient API that gracefully throttles excessive requests with HTTP 429.",
      "codeSnippet": "import rateLimit from \"express-rate-limit\";\n\n// Global limiter: 100 requests per 15 minutes per IP\nexport const globalLimiter = rateLimit({\n  windowMs: 15 * 60 * 1000, // 15 minutes\n  max: 100, // Max 100 requests per IP per window\n  standardHeaders: true, // Return standard RateLimit-* headers\n  legacyHeaders: false, // Disable X-RateLimit-* headers\n  message: {\n    status: 429,\n    message: \"Too many requests from this IP, please try again after 15 minutes\"\n  }\n});\n\napp.use(\"/api\", globalLimiter);"
