      "type": "lab",
      "codeLanguage": "javascript",
      "summary": "ការរៀបចំ Multer DiskStorage លើ Local Filesystem៖\n\n- **destination**៖ កំណត់ Folder ផ្ទុកឯកសារ (ឧ. `'uploads/courses/'`)។\n- **Unique Filename**៖ បង្កើតឈ្មោះ File មិនឱ្យជាន់គ្នាដោយប្រើ `crypto.randomUUID()` ឬ Timestamp + Extension។\n- **Static Serving**៖ បើកឱ្យទាញយកតាមរយៈ `app.use('/uploads', express.static('uploads'))` ក្នុង Development។",
      "tip": "Always generate random filenames (e.g. `user-123-1773729600.jpg`) rather than saving `file.originalname`, which may contain spaces or path traversal characters (`../../`).",
      "objective": "Configure Multer diskStorage with deterministic path generation and collision-free names.",
      "expectedOutcome": "Organized on-disk storage with sanitized, collision-free file naming.",
      "codeSnippet": "import multer from \"multer\";\nimport path from \"node:path\";\nimport crypto from \"node:crypto\";\n\nconst storage = multer.diskStorage({\n  destination: (req, file, cb) => {\n    cb(null, \"public/uploads/avatars\");\n  },\n  filename: (req, file, cb) => {\n    // Generate: user-<id>-<randomHex><ext>\n    const uniqueSuffix = crypto.randomBytes(8).toString(\"hex\");\n    const ext = path.extname(file.originalname).toLowerCase();\n    cb(null, `user-${req.user?._id || \"anon\"}-${uniqueSuffix}${ext}`);\n  },\n});\n\nexport const uploadAvatarLocal = multer({ storage });"
