      "expectedOutcome": "Readiness to integrate any S3-compatible cloud storage provider into Node.js.",
      "codeSnippet": "// S3 Object Storage Concept:\n//\n// Endpoint: https://<account_id>.r2.cloudflarestorage.com\n// Bucket:   \"my-enterprise-bucket\"\n// Key:      \"avatars/64f1a2b3-avatar.webp\"\n//\n// Client Upload Request -> Node.js API -> S3 PutObjectCommand -> Cloudflare R2 / AWS S3\n// Web Browser <- Cloudflare CDN Edge (https://cdn.myapp.com/avatars/64f1a2b3-avatar.webp)"
